    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The learning-rate range test, the standard first step before tuning anything else. Train once on the whole training split per step, starting at lr 0.0001 and multiplying it by 1.2 every epoch for 60 epochs, up to about 5. The loss first barely moves, then falls, then blows up. The script finds the lowest point and takes a tenth of that rate: lowest loss 0.472 at lr 0.439; diverged by lr 0.632; suggested lr 0.044. The branch below is ordinary training with that pick typed into its Optimizer (lr 0.04); it reaches test accuracy 0.978.\n\n學習率範圍測試，調其他參數之前的標準第一步。每一步用整份訓練資料訓練一次，學習率從 0.0001 開始，每個 epoch 乘以 1.2，跑 60 個 epoch，最後約到 5。loss 一開始幾乎不動，接著下降，最後爆掉。腳本找出最低點，取那個學習率的十分之一：lowest loss 0.472 at lr 0.439; diverged by lr 0.632; suggested lr 0.044。下方的分支是一般的訓練，把挑出的值填進它的 Optimizer（lr 0.04），測試正確率是 0.978。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-axis",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 3260,
        "y": -312
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Each step along the x axis multiplies the learning rate by 1.2, so the axis is logarithmic. A pick cannot be wired into a parameter, so it is copied by hand: that keeps the confirming run readable on its own.\n\nx 軸每前進一格，學習率就乘以 1.2，所以這是對數刻度。挑出的值沒辦法用線接進參數，所以要手動抄過去；這樣確認用的那次訓練單獨看也看得懂。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "curve",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 380,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 320
      }
